id=ios_boot
name=iOS beside Android (dual boot)
version=1
versionCode=1
author=cubs port
description=Android is the default. Start iOS on request: the flag file /data/local/ios/boot_ios at boot (written by `sh /data/local/ios/ios_next.sh`, which also reboots), or three volume-down presses within 60 s after the boot finishes. Back to Android: hold power + volume down for 3 s on iOS.
